dules <MATH_0010> and <MATH_0011>\nwhich have positive rank at every <MATH_0012> such that\n<MATH_0013>\nas <MATH_0014>-algebras. The <TEXTITOPEN_0003>Brauer group<TEXTITCLOSE_0003> of\n<MATH_0015> is the set <MATH_0016> of equivalence classes of Azumaya\n<MATH_0017>-algebras with the operation induced by tensor product (over\n<MATH_0018>).\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ad470f4b4ebe4c89f440fba49f38565b1629cdac793f0988612a168e7d154803", "unit_id": "tag:0A2J:prose-0001"}
